		<name>LightAlarm</name>
		<summary>Sunrise alarm with dawn light, nature sounds and sun-synced alarms</summary>
		<desc>LightAlarm wakes you with a simulated sunrise. Before the alarm, the screen
slowly brightens from deep red to sky blue, gentle nature sounds fade in,
and the flashlight can switch on at the end.

* Light lead time, colors and brightness curve per alarm
* Built-in waves, rain, wind and chimes (no audio files), or any sound
* Sun alarms that follow the real sunrise or dawn for any place, computed
  offline, with a date-by-date table
* Offline world map, GPS or typed coordinates
* Light and dark themes
* No internet permission, no tracking, tiny (about 160 KB)</desc>
